OL,3,GNEWSAHow did a council fall to no
OL,4,Aoverall control?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2025 Reform UK took control of West
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire Council as part of its
OL,8,Ffirst wave of electoral success. The
OL,9,Fauthority was created in 2021 after its
OL,10,Fpredecessor effectively went bankrupt.
OL,11,FNow 18 months after taking power,
OL,12,FReform has lost overall control of the
OL,13,Fcouncil, which is in discussions with
OL,14,Fthe government about receiving
OL,15,Ffinancial help.
OL,17,FHow did the council get here and what
OL,18,Fcould happen next?
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
