OL,3,GNEWSAHow did a council fall to no
OL,4,Aoverall control?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2018 Conservative-run
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire County Council was
OL,8,Fcalled the "worst-run" authority in the
OL,9,Fcountry by the then Kettering MP Philip
OL,10,FHollobone.
OL,12,FDire financial problems meant all but
OL,13,Fessential spending was banned on two
OL,14,Foccasions and government-appointed
OL,15,Finspectors were sent in to oversee
OL,16,Foperations.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
